WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:05.000
I was... I was forced! Since this was all Chu Huan's scheme,

00:05.400 --> 00:08.500
Eldest Brother, surely you can release me now?

00:12.160 --> 00:16.500
Second Brother... you truly possess the cold ruthlessness of an emperor.

00:16.720 --> 00:23.000
Discarding your loyal retainer without batting an eye—in this, I am far inferior to you.

00:22.840 --> 00:26.500
Yet perhaps... it is a lesson I ought to learn.
